'''Dead End Night''' (終わりを告げる夜 ''Owariwotsugeru Yoru'', '''The Night That Will Tell the End''') is the 23rd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], this is the 16th and final sub-chapter and is available up to 3 ★.

==Difficulty==
Although substantially easier than some of the preceding sub-chapters, it is still not to be taken lightly due to its variety of tricky stages. Expect to change your lineup frequently in this sub-chapter.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Le'noir]]: A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Le'boin]] with way higher health and damage, along with slightly increased range.
*[[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy and smaller variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] that has exceptional range and attack power, but attacks and moves slowly.

When the final stage is completed, players have a 30% chance (guaranteed if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used) to unlock Li'l Nyandam as a [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] whereas the Nintendo Switch port is guaranteed.

