==Trivia==
*This is the second time the player visits this map layout. The first time was in [[Capone's Jail]]. This time, however, the player is in the cordoned-off western part of the complex.
*The info screen shown when tapping the speech bubble next to Dead End Night in the [[Legend Stages]] menu refers to [[Dark Premonition]] as Black Premonition, which was its name before [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 15.3 Update|15.3]].
*On the day [[Version 15.4 Update|15.4]] released, the info screen shown when tapping the speech bubble in BCEN now displays all text in Chinese. It is likely that this was meant to fix [[Dark Premonition]] being listed as Black Premonition, but instead has the text from BCTW. This was then fixed the next day.

